Your account has been deleted

@if(because === 'workspace_deleted')
The owner of your workspace asked for it to be deleted, and your account was deleted with it. You can no longer sign in, and this is the last email we will send to this address about it.
@else
As you asked, we have deleted your account. You can no longer sign in with it, and this is the last email we will send to this address about it.
@end

Some records are kept because we have to — payments and invoices, and the security log — but they no longer carry your name or email address.
